WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.800
THE ASCENSION OF ANGELS

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:26.800
"The Ascension of Angels."

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.160
The rings are separating!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.130
The psychickers are spilling out!

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:41.000
This wasn't part of the plan!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.030
Ring drifting in from portside!

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.160
Evade!

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.900
Enemy ships ahead! Intercept while avoiding the rings!

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.130
Don't flee, Sugan!

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:54.230
Has the machine turned against us?

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.460
Was there a rejection by the psychickers?

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:58.900
I have to investigate!

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.830
Angel Halo is separating!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.700
Can't you see something's wrong?!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.160
Shahkti, are you okay? What's happening to Angel Halo?!

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:29.530
I'm giving the order for defensive combat, but...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.760
I can't control the cannons!

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:34.260
What's happening to the key room controls?

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.860
There's no answer! We have to evacuate!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.960
What's happening?

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.760
Princess, what are you doing with Angel Halo?

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:55.130
To those still in the control room and on the bridge, please save yourselves.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.430
Even I don't know what's going to happen.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:04.230
The prayers of the psychickers who wish for peace are making this happen.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:09.330
Cronicle! It was your weakness that led Miss Katejina astray!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.030
Do you still not understand?!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.930
What would a boy like you know?

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.900
You have no idea how I've suffered as the queen's younger brother,

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:23.000
having to fight against Kagatie and all the rest!

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:37.200
If you're competing for me, then give it all you've got.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.330
Miss Katejina?!

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:45.800
Dammit!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.200
Time to die, boy!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.900
Üso, if you're both just fighting with hatred, you'll die together!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.760
Not bad!

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.300
You saved me, Odelo. Thanks.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.830
They're the only ones left here.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.830
Tomáš, where'd that guy go?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.130
He hid among the ring blocks.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.930
They're still flying, even separated...

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.960
If they have that ability, then...

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.430
Clear away from me!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:28.830
How do I fight against their blind hatred?!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.230
What should I do? Tell me!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.060
Dad... Dad!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.660
Don't shoot the rings! There are civilian psychickers inside!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.700
That's human blood, isn't it?!

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.860
Sugan, I'm going back to Angel Halo!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:05:00.430
T-That's reckless! Even we have no idea what's happening!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.630
Enemy ship!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:02.560
What?!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:03.960
Is that...

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.600
The Jeanne d'Arc!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.330
Handle it, Sugan.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.330
Sir!

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:19.830
We're turning too slowly! Don't blow up the enemy ship's engines!

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.100
How did it touch us?!

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.660
Fire side engines 16 through 22!

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:53.930
The curse of Jinn Jahannam? Did Maria summon it?

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.900
Maria, save me!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.630
Odelo! Tomáš!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.660
Just get to the center of Angel Halo!

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.360
Shahkti might have something to do with all of this!

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.300
Shahkti's doing this?

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.300
Nothing a machine this massive does should surprise us.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.200
Yeah. It's a psycommu, right?

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:01.230
Now, listen to your elders and get going, little brother!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.100
R-Right, Odelo!

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.860
Good. A little brother should always obey his big brother.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.960
Tomáš, they're here!

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:10.430
Üso, go!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.300
Those...

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:34.430
A rich girl from Uwig should act like a rich girl!

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.430
Why won't they leave?

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.600
What's this light?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.200
It's making me sick!

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.660
What?!

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.160
She's stopped?

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:54.360
If I'm going to get her, it should be now, but...

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:56.960
This light!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.830
It's making my flesh crawl!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:08.730
Üso! I did this to buy you some time!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:11.600
Odelo!

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.230
Odelo?

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.930
What... What's happening to me?

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.160
Hey!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.460
Mom?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.500
You're praising me?

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:35.530
Dad... You always hated me...

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.460
You didn't?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.500
Really?

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.160
Someone I know... Odelo!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.700
No, Mr. Romero, too. And Captain Gomez.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.330
Mr. Jinn Jahannam, Üso's father.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.530
Everyone... Everyone is...

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.260
Elisha, don't stand up during combat!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.330
Miss Elisha, what's wrong?!

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:23.100
Odelo... Odelo's dead!

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:25.400
Odelo's dead!

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:33.300
I know everything, Üso Ewin!

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:37.700
With Shahkti's help in the key room, you plan to wipe us out!

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.030
That's it... I see it, too!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.800
How dare you, you white monster!

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:56.660
A hard heart and weapons are dangerous together, Mr. Cronicle!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:06.730
I-Impossible! I can't be stopped here!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.400
Cronicle!

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.200
Sister! Maria! Save me!

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.300
Maria!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:46.060
Is death the only thing that can make amends for the sins of man?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:50.100
Is prayer unable to erase men's deeds?

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.830
What's this shaking? Maria! Tell me!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:06.500
Was this operation doomed from the start, like that boy said?!

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.500
You won't even look at me, Maria?

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.300
You've forgotten how I raised you up from a mere fortune teller.

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.400
How dare you treat me like this?!

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:30.260
You mock me, Maria!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.930
They split apart, and now they're coming back together!

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:46.160
Why do you think it's ascending, Miss Marbet?

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.900
How should I know?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:52.260
It means Angel Halo isn't a weapon anymore!

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:56.700
Yeah, I think Martina's right.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.960
No matter what you use as a shield, I can still see you!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.660
A ring? And another, from behind?

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:29.730
Miss Katejina?

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.660
You love me, don't you, Üso?

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.630
You've always loved me, haven't you?

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:37.860
What?

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:43.400
It makes me happy that a boy like you thinks of me that way.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.760
Careful! Near miss enemy!

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.530
It's Miss Katejina...

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.560
This battle is settled.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.460
You've won.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:56.560
But I loved Cronicle, so I can't embrace you.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.530
So, kill me.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:03.430
You don't have to die! The war's over now!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:06.000
That doesn't matter!

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.360
After the way I've fought you till now,

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.960
going to join Cronicle is all I have left!

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:14.400
If so, then let your strong arms send me to him!

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:22.230
You're such a naïve little boy!

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:30.800
Dammit!

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:36.230
Üso, speed increasing! Hurry!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.730
Stubborn little...

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:44.100
Cronicle, I'll make an offering of this white monster to you! And then...

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:48.200
I missed? But how?!

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.630
Üso! We're falling! We're falling!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.800
I know!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:03.460
Set course for the homeland! Stop firing!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.130
Mobile suits, return!

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:08.130
Stop firing! We've broadcasted our surrender!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.160
Gather the mobile suits!

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:15.130
The ship will never make it back to Zanscare in its condition!

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.230
Captain!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:18.560
Couldn't we ride those ring fragments back?

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.530
You think we can ride those things?! Those things are...

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.060
What?!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.460
The rings are surrounding us!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.260
Where are they taking us?! Help!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:35.860
Angel Halo's center is still intact!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:38.930
Maintain 360 degree watch! We're still in combat!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:44.830
Karl?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.400
Shahkti!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.700
Shahkti, come back!

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:58.700
Karl!

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.000
He's standing!

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.700
Karl spoke!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.400
Maintain air watch!

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:04.760
R-Right!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.760
Karl is suddenly standing and can speak.

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.860
Is this the work of Angel Halo?

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.730
Shahkti, the battle's over. Come out!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.800
Where?

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.160
If I shoot through there...

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.760
If you shoot here, you'll blow Shahkti away!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:33.560
Odelo! Then where?!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.460
Not here?

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.200
Go back outside?

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.860
Miss Junko... Mr. Oliver...

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:52.660
Right! The enemy I have to defeat is...

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:56.800
There's still someone we can't just ignore.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.200
An ambush!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:19.260
Miss Katejina, you'd really go that far?!

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:26.100
I knew you'd come. The naïve little boy!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:30.260
You think you can just destroy this ship and everyone lives happily ever after?!

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:37.300
You insult me! Like a child! Like a...

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.300
Believe in the V2!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:42.560
Üso!

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.860
Don't trick me!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.330
Gundam!

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:02.900
Enemy has vanished! It worked, Üso!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.100
What's happening?!

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.900
Enemy ship is ascending! What do we do?

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.100
What about Shahkti?!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.060
The power's dropping! Is it hopeless?

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.800
It looks like it.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.600
Gundam! Rise to the heavens!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:36.000
T-This can't be... This can't be!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:36.700
Haro...

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:43.130
What?!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:43.960
Haro?

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.800
That's... the key room ring!

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:42.100
Sis?

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.160
Just wait a little longer.

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.230
Oh, yeah. It's getting colder,

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:56.530
so I'll keep an eye on your pendant, Odelo.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:59.230
I'll come back to shovel the snow...

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.760
I'd just like to wear this during winter.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.330
Sorry for the wait!

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.230
Suzy, Miss Marbet, we're going.

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.160
I'll ride with Üso.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:13.060
Mathis Walker's wife comes here all the time.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:16.600
What will you do if you fall from there, huh?

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:30.930
Is somebody there?

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:33.630
Yes, can I help you?

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:35.500
Quiet.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.960
The wappa's auto-compass is broken.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:40.960
I don't know which way I'm going.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.330
Which way to Uwig?

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:46.960
Oh, it's a little further south from here.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:51.200
I have a spare compass at home. I'll let you have it.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:56.330
You can just tell me. I have no money.

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.500
You're blind, aren't you?

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:01.400
It's okay. I'll be right back.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.100
He-llo!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:10.160
Hello. What's your name?

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:11.530
Karl!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:11.730
Just because love is torn apart hikisakareta ai ga

